{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_065f2fe477a18683bce6f91d9a58df7e4fa9e1f865d7b3d715ea1823dd1dd085","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_801f72c4787e970612185789ea25510eeeb0d2617b4cf5992aa3a8206688b4a5","slc_87ef729698f12aa1ba6e4b6300dbd490914b429980b5e461ba640ff0dc310e7c","slc_921307a47146a85be8a563962e24361e85fa9bdfd99bea60f2d77c75b488f150"],"source_ids":["src_e744b8d896d35341bc34a342fa2260a3"],"text":"Agent runs use idempotent creation keyed by a submission identifier, renewable run claims that reject stale workers, durable tool-job records taken before and after execution, and cancellation propagated from durable state to local operations.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1c50d5a0b542952087f765f2d08359e99c69a7f20db29f7786ad6d65ee7cf463","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_34337b667eb8c1b7f0ff109f32a359fab8fea7b073cdea8c51ac96752e7c8214","slc_bf29ecf3b4baca564346de412a8c13c724e88dec7b38b39bdec71c59ae70c067"],"source_ids":["src_e744b8d896d35341bc34a342fa2260a3"],"text":"State is split by owner: Convex holds users, threads, durable transcript parts, runs, and tool-job records, while the local server keeps a thread summary cache, transcript replica, folder list, and pairing credentials; the WorkOS refresh token lives in the OS credential store.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1f1398bb65e383824d479e3a94e61e3476a93f7ec143702f485ac1532c62d2a2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_029ac1ac22aed8132348f79d6f65a0ee0bc2c716722b4df2f7a439eb10fa57fa","slc_ac22b9215ea8ab5003871645fe3106f17da97d8e68ee2ca681122be38c42a3f9","slc_bd038b8527a6e995565c02f67704784b842e3eaabf323fef95bb34ff112b2c32","slc_c68128a485da5740847ccae6a51b79258173cd761a7fa0a5704f61a45ce687bf","slc_e0ae9fe8b81f11135df9cf0dca013a8cc9f27253657879ccb4ebe7efb58110db"],"source_ids":["src_c7ae16c93eef5061b3fb9dc9fda8d42a"],"text":"The CLI supports commands such as login, run (with --thread), update/upgrade, serve (--api-only), and --web, and accepts a directory argument to attach a workspace.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2f6e4ed21fe4740b106ff75adc7cfaf94200325c793442e6835caac4b0afa56b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a240efde3f236736dcf5e1bf7be80ba083fba0c4d03f0df1c077d37bdc1e11ba"],"source_ids":["src_e744b8d896d35341bc34a342fa2260a3"],"text":"Workspace patches and shell commands are not sandboxed; they run with the permissions of the local Sprocket process and are confined only by the OS user.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4487cb3d0b9c46823931d6da034bedda3370f0ef42f8b51e41df96cb30944dfa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_54b257f2001a620fdfbfd465b4246204321e6074e9461887e4f43da8adec07fa","slc_5c40a06fc142e48ad7ef3438fe7684c77349d5e9fbd49824fb1b7efa2a8a36a1","slc_feb4fff700579b1cf1d11bff0ec7c4f96e7457bb18dec11b6db2ab76b5da3eb5"],"source_ids":["src_e744b8d896d35341bc34a342fa2260a3"],"text":"The product depends on an external private AI gateway (spikonado/ai-gateway) at https://ai-gateway.spikonado.com for model routing and quota checks, plus Convex and WorkOS AuthKit for state and identity.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_59409e350d1c608d1ee2310a718ac6fd7c20e00ab02f799bc673f55c497020ce","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e0b3fb49dfe9777fb408dc078b6ff890c3b32ab0ff73afbccaa11d72f02ca2e2"],"source_ids":["src_c7ae16c93eef5061b3fb9dc9fda8d42a"],"text":"Server behavior is configurable via environment variables including SPROCKET_DATA_DIR, SPROCKET_PORT (default 17731), SPROCKET_HOST (default 127.0.0.1), and SPROCKET_DESKTOP_EXECUTABLE.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_65c69b9d8c0b6a1ca9722907e644442d7645ad39a8242fe08bfaca3f5f36504b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5c40a06fc142e48ad7ef3438fe7684c77349d5e9fbd49824fb1b7efa2a8a36a1","slc_feb4fff700579b1cf1d11bff0ec7c4f96e7457bb18dec11b6db2ab76b5da3eb5"],"source_ids":["src_e744b8d896d35341bc34a342fa2260a3"],"text":"The system has three planes: a Svelte/Electron/CLI client plane, a local Rust execution plane that authenticates requests and runs tools, and a Convex cloud coordination plane with an AI gateway for completions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_69323f11f85543076f0a2d071191ae382c2186e81f52834afb879bbde9dfd558","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2e06e59ea07f5b1353e0f5b05cf92e901d8466e65febaab51b8c346fd4a199f7","slc_5c78c0553cdb2d7e59499b1fb7feab1e81f34c38b321981c9eb3e75c31b1e02b","slc_8ec7f7950d2b668b5275ba0e97fc9e7aa9b47db0fa1005576a5ee37fbf4de78e"],"source_ids":["src_469bb7bb7ea55b759c105dcd6d5807bb"],"text":"Repository development practice: BACKWARDS_COMPATIBILITY.md instructs that each compatibility layer's entry be removed when its removal PR merges, and that schema fields be dropped only after migrations complete and production scans find no remaining values.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7e7429d39d5824217c3c5522aecdd1ad5e1cf43414c23621966a5af0faaf5129","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_16ea38486015d1692db5f4585bb0124f11de6e449b79cd05091cb6506b1ef686"],"source_ids":["src_e744b8d896d35341bc34a342fa2260a3"],"text":"Artifact-bound files must be UTF-8 text within 500,000 bytes; missing or unreadable files report an error while keeping their last readable content, and the server does not recreate missing files from the cloud copy.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7fb3923df2fd1b7b5ae8fa22654da66957d938d8fd53d35ec51545b4ac3ad5cc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_79fc1189133dd0470bf8f473b8ee71f8a0f2e38429811051e04e10a3c84a37f5"],"source_ids":["src_e744b8d896d35341bc34a342fa2260a3"],"text":"Artifact tools include add_artifact, edit_artifact, list_artifacts, and save_artifact; save_artifact accepts an existing file only when its content is identical and never overwrites differing content.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9fd792a930f63d154ac48393eb5a42389b2fd4925b49c959d2e4c000b006deea","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ec9ea3b983d8fce4d066f4474860921a911c092de41a980e7463198c8fa6a4c4"],"source_ids":["src_e744b8d896d35341bc34a342fa2260a3"],"text":"Stated design principles include local execution of file and shell operations by a Rust process, durable coordination that survives interruptions, and layered implementation where workspace primitives avoid HTTP, Convex, and provider dependencies.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bc05466cf9f537bf91f1aaed05978117d6b15f6ff52d762484349a3b989231e9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bad42b11af807403bffe8334941b8717be6a3d7f24ee391ba0594e58db953c2b"],"source_ids":["src_e744b8d896d35341bc34a342fa2260a3"],"text":"The native authentication migration is incomplete: thread-cache registration, thread commands, cancellation, lifecycle, transcript synchronization, and attachments still pass browser access tokens or user IDs to Rust.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c005a2f376c25e924f4df3ca345e6311a15d4a670b4ed6b7bf6b4f4abdd63fb1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"spikonado/sprocket@f705b4375ade snapshot a70a95cc62364459","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2dac13e99109cf4030020344df44c6e349b3bb2386c463828513f1aa449b0296","slc_ca1a315bfcee7615b07e9faec980fed7b263bd6ec810b63293d0d45ac2c8d7ec","slc_e4d789a8e50ef4d0f1378fdc9224c4cd0baf9752c42853b2a7e8037bb25c738c","slc_f173ebc91bfb54f922a0bf99dfa2cb380ce6bea3dd8f0bba4c45359fec151c8a"],"source_ids":["src_c7ae16c93eef5061b3fb9dc9fda8d42a"],"text":"Repository development practice: building and testing use bun install, bun dev, cargo test, bun run test, bun run build, and prek run -a, with Bun 1.3.9+, Node.js 24.14+, and a stable Rust toolchain required.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:42:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_ced1cd4ef8a7485285dbcf625fbb902c"}
